{
  "slug": "forms",
  "title": "Forms",
  "titleRu": "Форма",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explanation",
      "md": "Present Simple называет то, что бывает снова и снова, или то, что верно вообще. Форма короткая: к глаголу либо ничего не добавляется, либо **-s**."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": ["I / you / we / they", "he / she / it"],
      "rows": [
        ["work", "works"],
        ["live", "lives"],
        ["like", "likes"]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "I work here.",
      "ru": "Я здесь работаю."
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "She works here.",
      "ru": "Она здесь работает."
    },
    {
      "type": "pitfall",
      "ruleId": "ps-third-person-s",
      "md": "После he / she / it русскоязычные часто оставляют глагол без **-s**: she work. Нужно **she works**."
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-forms-01",
      "ruleId": "ps-third-person-s",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "She ___ in London.",
      "options": ["live", "lives"],
      "answer": "lives"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-forms-02",
      "ruleId": "ps-base-form",
      "kind": "choice",
      "prompt": "They ___ English.",
      "options": ["speak", "speaks"],
      "answer": "speak"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "id": "ps-forms-03",
      "ruleId": "ps-third-person-s",
      "kind": "pick-sentence",
      "prompt": "Which sentence is correct?",
      "options": ["He like coffee.", "He likes coffee."],
      "answer": "He likes coffee."
    },
    {
